---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Kitty from '../components/Kitty.astro';
import StepIllustration from '../components/StepIllustration.astro';
import ToolCard from '../components/ToolCard.astro';
import { tools } from '../data/tools';
---
<Layout>
<section class="shell hero"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="pill"><span class="status-dot"></span> Small tasks, meet your new sidekick</span><h1>Little tools.<br />Big <span class="headline-accent">possibilities.</span></h1><p class="hero-description">Everyday files, a little less fuss.<br />Free, friendly tools that help you get things done.<br class="desktop-break" /> With a little help from Loki.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a data-loki-transition class="button" href="/tools/image-converter/">Let’s make something easier <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-notes" aria-label="Our commitments"><span>✓ Completely free</span><span>✓ No sign-up</span><span>✓ Yours stays yours</span></div></div>
<div class="hero-scene"><div class="scene-grid"></div><span class="scene-caption">YOUR EVERYDAY SIDEKICK</span><div class="kitty-greeting">Hey, I'm Loki <span aria-hidden="true">✦</span></div><Kitty /><div class="file-tile file-one"><span>▧</span><strong>PNG</strong></div><div class="file-tile file-two"><span>▧</span><strong>WebP</strong><i>✓</i></div><div class="scene-bottom"><span class="status-dot"></span> A little mischief. A lot of help.</div><span class="scene-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div></section>
<div class="promise-strip"><div class="shell flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-4"><span>Less busywork. More good stuff.</span><span>Local processing <i>✦</i> Zero accounts <i>✦</i> A friendlier internet</span></div></div>
<div class="shell toolbox-jump"><a class="text-link" href="#tools">Explore the toolbox <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
<section class="shell section" id="tools"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE LITTLE TOOLBOX</p><h2>Big help for small tasks.</h2></div><p class="muted max-w-80">Start with images. More everyday essentials are on their way.</p></div><div class="category-row" role="group" aria-label="Filter tool categories"><button class="category-active" data-category-filter="All" aria-pressed="true">All tools <span>3</span></button><button data-category-filter="Images" aria-pressed="false">Images <span>1 live</span></button><button data-category-filter="Documents" aria-pressed="false">Documents <span>Soon</span></button><button data-category-filter="Text" aria-pressed="false">Text <span>Soon</span></button></div><p class="sr-only" id="category-status" role="status"></p><div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">{tools.map(tool => <ToolCard tool={tool} />)}</div><p class="tool-footnote">A growing collection, built with care. Only tools marked “Ready to use” are available.</p></section>
<section class="shell section how-section" id="how-it-works"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">NO MANUAL REQUIRED</p><h2>Done in a few little steps.</h2></div><span class="handwritten" aria-hidden="true">Loki’s got your back ⤵</span></div><div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">{[{n:'01',title:'Drop it in.',text:'Pick your image or drag it into the tool. It stays right on your device.'},{n:'02',title:'Make it yours.',text:'Choose your format and let Loki help with the little details.'},{n:'03',title:'Off you go.',text:'Download your fresh file. No account, no email, no extra hoops.'}].map(step => <div class="step"><StepIllustration step={step.n} /><span>{step.n}</span><h3>{step.title}</h3><p class="muted">{step.text}</p></div>)}</div></section>
<section class="shell section" id="our-promise"><div class="privacy-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR FILES. YOUR BUSINESS.</p><h2>Your files stay yours.<br />Loki stands guard.</h2><p>Your images are processed in your browser. They never leave your device. No account to create, no files for us to store. Just you, your work, and Loki.</p><a class="text-link" href="/tools/image-converter/">Try it for yourself <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="privacy-guardian"><div class="guardian-scene"><Kitty interactive={true} /><svg class="guardian-shield" viewBox="0 0 120 140" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M60 8L108 27V66C108 99 83 121 60 132C37 121 12 99 12 66V27Z"/><rect x="42" y="60" width="36" height="31" rx="7"/><path d="M48 60V49a12 12 0 0 1 24 0v11"/><circle cx="60" cy="74" r="3"/></svg><span class="guardian-spark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span></div><strong>100% on your device</strong><p>No uploads. No peeking.<br />Your privacy is never a paid extra.</p></div></div></section>
<script src="../scripts/catalogue.ts"></script>
</Layout>